# Use Link, not `<a>`

For any in-app navigation, use the app's `Link` component. Do not use a raw `<a>`.

- **Web (Next.js):** `import Link from "next/link"`
- **Admin (React Router):** `import { Link } from "react-router"`

This includes hash routes (`#courses`), auth pages (`/login`), and CTAs.

```tsx
// BAD
<a href="/login">Login</a>
<a href="#courses">Start Your Quest</a>

// GOOD
<Link href="/login">Login</Link>
<Link href="#courses">Start Your Quest</Link>
```

Reserve `<a>` only for external URLs (`https://...`) or `mailto:` / `tel:`.
